# examples/planner/.env.example
#
# Copy this file to examples/planner/.env and paste your D-Wave Leap API token
# between the quotes below. The .env file is gitignored — do not commit it.
#
# How to get a token:
#   1. Sign up at https://cloud.dwavesys.com/leap/signup/
#   2. Verify your e-mail.
#   3. The dashboard shows your API token under the "API Token" section.
#   4. Copy it and paste below.
#
# Free tier: 1 minute of QPU time per month. Each planner call in this demo
# uses single-digit milliseconds, so a single month's quota covers hundreds
# of runs.

DWAVE_API_TOKEN=
